[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11225.95, "timestamp": "03:07:05", "text": "等待我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11228.63, "timestamp": "03:07:08", "text": "后退。遗憾的是，周围并没有任何相似之处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11230.55, "timestamp": "03:07:10", "text": "如何摧毁这股强大的力量？为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11234.03, "timestamp": "03:07:14", "text": "现在，我们必须躲起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11237.349, "timestamp": "03:07:17", "text": "是的，他就是凯恩。凯恩手里的牌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11240.349, "timestamp": "03:07:20", "text": "墙石。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11244.15, "timestamp": "03:07:24", "text": "我设想一下，如果他变成了一个坏人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11246.389, "timestamp": "03:07:26", "text": "世界将会怎样？什么会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11256.63, "timestamp": "03:07:36", "text": "塔尔·拉沙的仪式揭示了第三个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11265.11, "timestamp": "03:07:45", "text": "去。一块神奇的文字石从中显现出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11270.79, "timestamp": "03:07:50", "text": "单词。你必须接受这一点，那就是事实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11272.83, "timestamp": "03:07:52", "text": "逆你而行。但你并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11275.429, "timestamp": "03:07:55", "text": "独自的。查鲁斯应该很快就到了。我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11277.11, "timestamp": "03:07:57", "text": "想不到会有人帮她。找到"}]